WEBVTT

00:02:13.360 --> 00:02:16.190
Tenchi!

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:21.870
Now where did he go?

00:02:50.230 --> 00:02:53.020
Did you finish cleaning, Tenchi?

00:02:56.650 --> 00:02:59.570
l bet you were
looking for these.

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.200
So that's where they are.

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:07.500
Trying to sneak in there
while l was out, were you?

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.960
No, l wasn't.

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.840
lt's been the forbidden area of
the Masaki Shrine,...

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:17.630
since the time of our ancestors.
And you are no exception.

00:03:17.630 --> 00:03:20.170
But you want to see
what's in there, don't you?

00:03:20.170 --> 00:03:20.680
Yes.

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.760
Here they are...

00:03:22.760 --> 00:03:25.680
They are yours
if you can take them from me.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:28.140
Let's see how good
you really are.

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:43.570
Work harder.

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.450
And remember your chores
are part of your training.

00:03:52.250 --> 00:03:57.170
Episode 1:
THE RESURRECTlON OF RYOKO

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:04.720
l just want to see what's in there,

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.600
'cause he told me not to.

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.050
Hey, Tenchi!

00:04:46.930 --> 00:04:50.890
Why must you come here time after time...
when you know you are not allowed?

00:04:50.890 --> 00:04:52.560
Why is that, Grandpa?

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:56.600
l'll tell you why.
A demon sleeps here.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.480
A demon?

00:04:58.060 --> 00:04:59.980
A long time ago,

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:05.150
an evil demon came here
from the sky one day.

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:09.490
ln one step,
it could cross three mountains.

00:05:09.490 --> 00:05:15.540
ln one strike, it could
flatten the biggest mountain.

00:05:15.540 --> 00:05:18.540
lt destroyed villages, burned everything.

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:22.340
Our people suffered greatly
because of its evil powers.

00:05:22.340 --> 00:05:25.720
What happened to the demon?

00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:29.760
One day, a ship like a dragon
appeared from the sky.

00:05:29.760 --> 00:05:32.600
On its back rode
a mighty samurai.

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:35.980
By the way, he was our ancestor.

00:05:35.980 --> 00:05:37.980
He fought the demon...

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:41.730
using a sword with
great spiritual powers.

00:05:41.730 --> 00:05:44.400
He finally defeated the demon...

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:46.490
and sealed it in this cave.

00:05:46.490 --> 00:05:50.910
Even now, the demon sleeps
in this shrine, held prisoner.

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:54.080
And the sword planted in the ground...

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:57.250
keeps watch over it.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:50.470
What? It's just a rusty
old piece of junk.

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.680
Give me a break!

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:55.680
This thing is supposed to
cut through rock?

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:20.870
Oh, no!

00:07:20.870 --> 00:07:23.790
What do l do now?

00:07:25.920 --> 00:07:28.340
A passageway?

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:36.310
That's cold!

00:07:36.720 --> 00:07:37.720
Water?

00:07:37.720 --> 00:08:01.620
Ouch!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:44.500
Oh, it's just a giant glowing light.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.040
No problem.

00:08:48.340 --> 00:08:50.130
l can't believe it.

00:08:52.590 --> 00:08:54.090
Oh, no.

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:58.550
lt can't be that demon
sealed by our ancestor.

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:02.100
lt wasn't just a legend.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.110
That was scary.

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:38.800
Let me go!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.020
Hey, Tenchi,
what have you got there?

00:11:57.150 --> 00:11:59.030
Nothing, just a piece of junk.

00:12:02.530 --> 00:12:04.070
So, Tenchi,...

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.700
how was your summer vacation?

00:12:06.580 --> 00:12:08.740
Same as usual.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:11.500
Just me and Grandpa
and work all day long.

00:12:11.500 --> 00:12:14.000
lt's supposed to be
all part of the training.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.420
You really are a bore.

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:19.170
Didn't you get to meet any girls?

00:12:19.380 --> 00:12:22.130
You think they'd come to a
shabby shrine in the mountains?

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:24.680
Hell, no.

00:12:24.680 --> 00:12:27.050
You can get to meet
only old men and women.

00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:28.390
Oh, no.

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:31.390
So you dated mummies
all summer?

00:12:31.390 --> 00:12:34.140
Mummies! That's a cruel thing to say.

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:39.110
A mummy?

00:12:48.080 --> 00:12:51.200
Hey, what's wrong, Tenchi?

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:51.830
Huh?

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:54.000
Don't tell me...

00:12:54.000 --> 00:12:57.330
you were so hard up
you slept with a mummy!

00:13:01.840 --> 00:13:03.420
Get a life, clown!

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:16.190
Nothing's happened since then.

00:13:16.190 --> 00:13:18.360
Grandpa never mentioned anything.

00:13:18.770 --> 00:13:22.320
l still can't believe
the legend was true.

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:58.650
Where am l?

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:02.320
Oh, great.
l fell asleep.

00:14:02.650 --> 00:14:06.110
l missed all my classes
this afternoon.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.950
Kitty...
How did you get in here?

00:14:20.880 --> 00:14:21.590
What?

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:37.390
Ryoko.

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:38.350
Huh?

00:14:39.850 --> 00:14:41.610
That's my name.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:44.780
lt can't be...

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:49.200
You can't be that--

00:14:54.490 --> 00:14:56.910
Freeze-dried demon!

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.870
lt was dark and cold in there.

00:15:02.790 --> 00:15:07.260
700 years have passed since
l was trapped in that cave.

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:09.930
You'll never know

00:15:10.800 --> 00:15:13.260
how much pain l had to suffer.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:15.640
So you came back for revenge!

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:17.600
Right.

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:19.770
lt's not my fault.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:22.560
lt was my ancestor.
Some guy named Yosho!

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.480
l don't care.

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:35.780
l just need to let out
my anger now.

00:15:40.370 --> 00:15:43.000
Why me? l told you
it's not my fault.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:49.970
What's the matter, Tenchi?

00:15:56.560 --> 00:16:00.230
lt's no fun
just running away, Tenchi.

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:12.820
Come on.

00:16:13.320 --> 00:16:15.240
Don't taunt me!

00:16:18.040 --> 00:16:19.120
Huh?

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:50.320
Try not to hurt yourself.

00:16:50.320 --> 00:16:52.070
l'd like to do that for you.

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.210
Ouch!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:35.610
For now...

00:17:35.610 --> 00:17:39.910
l'll just hide here
while l figure out a plan.

00:17:39.910 --> 00:17:43.160
What is that... that smell?

00:17:43.160 --> 00:17:45.960
Oh, gas fumes.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:47.830
Gas fumes?!

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:55.470
That blast must have...

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:59.890
l've got to do something, fast.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:01.930
Tenchi...

00:18:04.600 --> 00:18:06.100
Now what?

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.600
Tenchi.

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:15.860
Hello there.

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:28.670
l really like you.
You've got great energy.

00:18:28.830 --> 00:18:30.290
Tenchi.

00:18:31.040 --> 00:18:33.750
No! You idiot!
There's leaking gas!

00:18:33.750 --> 00:18:34.960
Gas?

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.720
What's that?

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:40.390
l can just see
the headlines--

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:44.310
''Brilliant Student Blown to Bits.''

00:18:44.510 --> 00:18:47.930
Oh no! lf l'd known
l was going to die today,...

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:52.110
l wouldn't have done all
that homework over vacation.

00:18:52.480 --> 00:18:53.650
Wait.

00:18:53.650 --> 00:18:56.280
l think l might just have an idea.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:03.830
Hey! What's that
outside the window?!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.370
There's no way in hell
this is going to work.

00:19:08.960 --> 00:19:11.830
What is it?
l want to see.

00:19:14.500 --> 00:19:17.420
Where?
Tell me where is it.

00:19:21.390 --> 00:19:24.010
Where? Where? What are you--

00:19:32.060 --> 00:19:33.400
Shit!

00:19:43.990 --> 00:19:45.620
There she goes.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.500
She was kind of cute.

00:19:53.880 --> 00:19:54.750
Huh?

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:58.510
l shouldn't have done it,
but it's an old shrine habit.

00:20:07.430 --> 00:20:10.270
l will never forgive you.

00:20:11.060 --> 00:20:12.810
She's still alive!

00:20:25.820 --> 00:20:27.030
Look at me.

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:28.580
My hair is a mess.

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.580
Oh, thank god.

00:20:41.010 --> 00:20:42.630
Now what do l do?

00:20:42.630 --> 00:20:44.840
She can rip holes in the roof.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:46.600
She can walk through fire.

00:20:46.600 --> 00:20:49.010
And she can even fly through walls.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:54.020
l must get out of here.

00:21:01.900 --> 00:21:04.400
O.K. Let's go.

00:21:19.670 --> 00:21:20.710
Take it easy.

00:21:20.710 --> 00:21:23.170
lt's only the stupid fire alarm.

00:21:27.970 --> 00:21:30.390
Why didn't it ring earlier?

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:34.230
That's what happens
when you use a cheap alarm.

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:41.820
Wait a minute.
Those jewels on her wrist.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:44.690
That's got to be
the source of her powers.

00:21:44.860 --> 00:21:46.660
The legend says so.

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:48.280
''Three gems for power.''

00:21:48.870 --> 00:21:50.530
Without her powers,...

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:52.700
that demon is just another girl.

00:21:52.700 --> 00:21:56.250
l can get her back in that cave.

00:21:58.460 --> 00:22:00.210
lt's so easy.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:02.840
There you are!

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:11.970
What the--

00:22:15.680 --> 00:22:18.100
Don't be so scared, sweetie-pie.

00:22:19.600 --> 00:22:22.650
l won't hurt you too much.

00:22:22.900 --> 00:22:25.240
Liaar!

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:26.440
Uh oh!

00:22:38.710 --> 00:22:39.960
Shit!

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:53.760
Too late!

00:22:57.350 --> 00:22:59.020
That's not playing fair, Tenchi!

00:22:59.020 --> 00:23:01.230
Give me a break!

00:23:02.520 --> 00:23:06.570
Nobody wants to fight
a monster like you!

00:23:09.700 --> 00:23:10.780
Monster?

00:23:14.370 --> 00:23:16.830
How dare you!

00:23:16.830 --> 00:23:20.710
Why do you call me a monster?

00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:24.040
You walk through fire,
you walk through walls.

00:23:24.040 --> 00:23:26.170
You rip holes in the roof.
You even fly!

00:23:26.170 --> 00:23:28.840
Very good reasons,
but not good enough!

00:23:58.290 --> 00:24:01.330
Oh, well.
Another battle lost.

00:24:01.330 --> 00:24:03.790
My miserable lot.

00:24:05.840 --> 00:24:07.130
Huh?

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:08.800
The sword did it.

00:24:08.800 --> 00:24:12.130
l didn't mean to cut off your hand.

00:24:12.130 --> 00:24:13.590
l'm sorry.

00:24:21.180 --> 00:24:21.980
See?

00:24:23.770 --> 00:24:24.440
Wow.

00:24:27.150 --> 00:24:28.400
Farewell.

00:24:43.960 --> 00:24:45.830
Oh, no!

00:24:45.830 --> 00:24:47.750
lf l stay here any longer,

00:24:47.750 --> 00:24:49.300
They'll think l caused this fire.

00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:51.340
l'm out of here.

00:25:23.870 --> 00:25:27.080
This sword sure is powerful.

00:25:27.920 --> 00:25:31.550
l wonder what happened
to that demon-girl?

00:25:31.760 --> 00:25:35.050
Was that really the end of her?

00:25:35.050 --> 00:25:36.050
Anyway,

00:25:36.590 --> 00:25:38.140
l'm so tired.

00:25:44.180 --> 00:25:46.230
lt can't be.

00:26:01.990 --> 00:26:04.290
Welcome home, Tenchi.

00:28:20.670 --> 00:28:22.680
PREVIEW OF NEXT EPISODE

00:28:24.340 --> 00:28:27.260
Now Ryoko's staying
at Tenchi's house.

00:28:27.260 --> 00:28:30.730
ln fact, she's a
horrible space pirate...

00:28:30.730 --> 00:28:33.230
who attacked our planet, Jurai.

00:28:33.230 --> 00:28:36.770
Yosho's disappearence and
Ayeka's escape,...

00:28:36.770 --> 00:28:38.820
were all caused by Ryoko.

00:28:38.820 --> 00:28:42.070
Ayeka is scary
when she is serious.

00:28:42.070 --> 00:28:45.370
Tenchi Muyo Episode #2:
Here comes Ayeka

00:28:45.370 --> 00:28:47.700
Ryoko, what will you do?

00:28:47.700 --> 00:28:50.540
HERE COMES AYEKA!
